REM Protects EXIT/LOAD/SAVE from losing their line-break-free numeric, identifier and file-id
REM operands, in upper, lower and mixed case, including the bare EXIT and bare SAVE forms.
errcode = 5
EXIT 1
exit 2
ExIt errcode
EXIT errcode
EXIT
exit
LOAD "prog1"
load "prog2"
LoAd "prog3"
LOAD "prog4",1
load "prog5",2
SAVE
save
SaVe
SAVE "data1"
save "data2"
